@baseUrl = http://localhost:5049
@token = paste-jwt-here

### List statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leadstatuses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create status (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leadstatuses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New" }

### Rename status (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/leadstatuses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Contacted" }

### Delete status (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/leadstatuses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing id returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leadstatuses/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
